      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i was moving some heavy boxes earlier today and felt this sudden sharp snap in my lower back. now it feels like there's this crazy shooting pain going all the way down my right leg and my foot feels kinda heavy/weak when i try to walk. u think i just pulled a muscle or something?",
